          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घुसणे — ghusṇe — \"to barge in; to force one's way in\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रात्री दोन चोर खिडकीतून घरात घुसले. rātrī don cor khiḍkītūn gharāt ghusle. At night two thieves forced their way into the house through the window."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो घुसला, to ghuslā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The place entered takes -त: घरात घुसणे (ghusṇe)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घुसणे (ghusṇe) is inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi ghusṇe, 'to enter forcibly', under ghuss, 'thrust in, pierce' (CDIAL 4492)."
            }
          ]
        },
